<title>USA: Perseptive, Incyte form alliance.</title>
<headline>Perseptive, Incyte form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerSeptive Biosystems Inc and Incyte Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Thursday they formed a genetic analysis alliance.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Under the deal, the companies would study the use of PerSeptive proprietary GeneSpectrometry technology to assist Incyte in generating genomic data for its LifeSeq database product, the companies said.</p>
</text>
